  "prompt": "For each country Voltmarkt's stores are in (the store's own country_code in stores), compare like-for-like net revenue in 2025 with 2024. Like for like means only stores open for the whole of both years: stores that opened on or before 1 January 2024 and have no close_date (the webshop counts as a store in its own country). Order dates are UTC days. Return four columns, in this order: country_code, revenue_2024_eur, revenue_2025_eur and growth_pct, the change as a percentage of the 2024 revenue (12.5 for 12.5%), rounded to 1 decimal. Return one row for each country with such a store. Any row order is fine.",
  "output_contract": {
    "columns": [
      {
        "name": "country_code",
        "type_class": "text"
      },
      {
        "name": "revenue_2024_eur",
        "type_class": "numeric"
      },
